    <summary>CostLike - your whole infrastructure bill, in one window.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
CostLike is a desktop app for cloud cost management across AWS, Azure,
Google Cloud, Hetzner Cloud and GitHub. Every account, every service, one
window - and your cost data never leaves your machine.

* **Cost Explorer** reports against any set of accounts, with grouping,
  filters, small multiples and drill-down. Every chart is also a table and
  a CSV.
* **A local cache**, so the same question is never paid for twice:
  re-slicing a report you already ran is free.
* **Govern** - budgets, anomalies, forecasts and local alert rules.
* **Allocate** - tag coverage, virtual tags, cost categories and unit
  economics.
* **Built-in MCP server** for Claude Desktop and other MCP clients, bound to
  127.0.0.1 and protected by a bearer token.
* No runtime to install, and nothing to sign in to on the Free plan.

## Package parameters

* `/CurrentUser` - install for the current user only, instead of for all
  users (the default).

Example:

```
choco install costlike --params "'/CurrentUser'"
```

## Notes

* The installer is downloaded from costlike.com at install time and verified
  with pinned SHA256 checksums. See VERIFICATION.txt for details.
* ARM64 Windows gets the native ARM64 build; every other 64-bit Windows gets
  the x64 build. There is no 32-bit build.
* Uninstalling leaves your local database and settings in place, because the
  cached cost history cost real money to build.
* CostLike is proprietary software. By installing it you accept the CostLike
  End User Licence Agreement, included in this package as LICENSE.txt.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://costlike.com/download/</releaseNotes>
